{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie God: a tongue-in-rotting-cheek spin on the \u2019God Game\u2019 genre. Unleash your inner deity and command your undead minions!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/e6093cd8e9743a7df658e3a0363ffc42.poster.avif?t=1757939412\" width=629 height=51 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/e6093cd8e9743a7df658e3a0363ffc42.webm?t=1757939412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever fancied yourself as a divine puppeteer of the undead? If so, then Zombie God may be the ultimate brain eating power trip. Feel the Zombie God\u2019s power at your fingertips, overcome the pesky uninfected and watch the world rot! But be careful, the forces of the living can themselves, bite back.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/3c1924ffb10aaedc1496da6f66d46ace.poster.avif?t=1757939412\" width=628 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/3c1924ffb10aaedc1496da6f66d46ace.webm?t=1757939412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/3c1924ffb10aaedc1496da6f66d46ace.mp4?t=1757939412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Watch as the increasingly desperate humans develop new and more powerful defences to combat your green tide. From the humble patrol car to a mighty tank, the challenge will keep on increasing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/851b14970970ec2be89935b0421218c5.poster.avif?t=1757939412\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/851b14970970ec2be89935b0421218c5.gif?t=1757939412\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>Spawn special zombies and use your unholy abilities to overcome the ever evolving defences of the doomed survivors \u2013 because who said ending the world can't be fun? Bursters explode onto the scene with a gooey finish, spitters keep their distance whilst laying down their own firepower and bulkers, whilst not outwitting anything can surely dish out the pain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to your mighty green friends the Zombie God always comes prepared, unleash torrents of goo rain, mutate your zombies and spread the infection brick by brick.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the apocalypse in a God-game / RTS mashup</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your zombies by modifying their ghoulish DNA</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boil brews and craft devices to improve your abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shamble through detailed maps with hordes of undead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly harder challenges through NG+ </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special infected and abilities to conquer the living</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/f2006f67241ad7e985d54741d1b9e38e.poster.avif?t=1757939412\" width=629 height=59 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/f2006f67241ad7e985d54741d1b9e38e.webm?t=1757939412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your fellow shamblers in worship in the official Zombie God Discord &amp; subreddit where you will find news, updates, memes and more!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3035320?t=1757939412","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757939412","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/f6da45a1d6c35c872719cf7eae53cddac6c71713/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757939412","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/f6da45a1d6c35c872719cf7eae53cddac6c71713/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757939412","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Cartoon depictions of violence, blood & gore."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie God: a tongue-in-rotting-cheek spin on the \u2019God Game\u2019 genre. Unleash your inner deity and command your undead minions!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/e6093cd8e9743a7df658e3a0363ffc42.poster.avif?t=1757939412\" width=629 height=51 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/e6093cd8e9743a7df658e3a0363ffc42.webm?t=1757939412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever fancied yourself as a divine puppeteer of the undead? If so, then Zombie God may be the ultimate brain eating power trip. Feel the Zombie God\u2019s power at your