he infection brick by brick.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the apocalypse in a God-game / RTS mashup</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your zombies by modifying their ghoulish DNA</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boil brews and craft devices to improve your abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shamble through detailed maps with hordes of undead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly harder challenges through NG+ </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special infected and abilities to conquer the living</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/f2006f67241ad7e985d54741d1b9e38e.poster.avif?t=1757939412\" width=629 height=59 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/f2006f67241ad7e985d54741d1b9e38e.webm?t=1757939412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your fellow shamblers in worship in the official Zombie God Discord &amp; subreddit where you will find news, updates, memes and more!</p>","developers":["Codematik"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/283618ccd93ab80192759292164e242780bee48a/header.jpg?t=1757939412","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3035320/1420609599/56d364685af08ca14c9b3ce2f3c5a2067dbfcd92/1757935979/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757939410","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/30353