amstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/d51b32d6b41587cad16b756c9de67ef91d2b7e6d/ss_d51b32d6b41587cad16b756c9de67ef91d2b7e6d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757939412","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/d51b32d6b41587cad16b756c9de67ef91d2b7e6d/ss_d51b32d6b41587cad16b756c9de67ef91d2b7e6d.600x338.jpg?t=1757939412"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/0286583436701b9129e16f209a8f2fcd32b0bd5f/ss_0286583436701b9129e16f209a8f2fcd32b0bd5f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757939412","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/0286583436701b9129e16f209a8f2fcd32b0bd5f/ss_0286583436701b9129e16f209a8f2fcd32b0bd5f.600x338.jpg?t=1757939412"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/b1a211c2bb48caf6da24555899d7190dc460a6d5/ss_b1a211c2bb48caf6da24555899d7190dc460a6d5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757939412","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/b1a211c2bb48caf6da24555899d7190dc460a6d5/ss_b1a211c2bb48caf6da24555899d7190dc460a6d5.600x338.jpg?t=1757939412"}],"short_description":"Zombie God: A strategy game with a roguelike twist. Try your zombified hand at commanding the undead to do your bidding! Upgrade your zombies and abilities to take down increasingly desperate humans and their city's defences.","steam_appid":3035320,"support_info":{"email":"support@codematik.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}